iddle" class="mkt-mono absolute top-0 whitespace-nowrap text-caption text-fg-subtle -translate-x-1/2" style="left:38.73959362622505%">5</span><span data-axis-label="true" data-anchor="middle" class="mkt-mono absolute top-0 whitespace-nowrap text-caption text-fg-subtle -translate-x-1/2" style="left:50.000000000000014%">10</span><span data-axis-label="true" data-anchor="middle" class="mkt-mono absolute top-0 whitespace-nowrap text-caption text-fg-subtle -translate-x-1/2" style="left:61.260406373774956%">20</span><span data-axis-label="true" data-anchor="middle" class="mkt-mono absolute top-0 whitespace-nowrap text-caption text-fg-subtle -translate-x-1/2" style="left:76.14585391911677%">50</span><span data-axis-label="true" data-anchor="middle" class="mkt-mono absolute top-0 whitespace-nowrap text-caption text-fg-subtle -translate-x-1/2" style="left:87.40626029289174%">100</span><span data-axis-label="true" data-anchor="end" class="mkt-mono absolute top-0 whitespace-nowrap text-caption text-fg-subtle -translate-x-full" style="left:100%">XLM</span></div></div></div><div class="mkt-reveal  " style="transition-delay:200ms"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-white/6 bg-white/[0.015] px-6 py-5 text-center sm:flex-row sm:text-left"><div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/8 bg-white/[0.03]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link h-4 w-4 text-accent" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></div><div class="flex-1"><p class="text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Each close counted here was completed through LumenWipe. Before being recorded, the backend confirms the transaction hash is a successful<!-- --> <code class="mkt-mono text-label text-white/70">ACCOUNT_MERGE</code> on the Stellar blockchain - merges done outside LumenWipe are not included. Every row in the feed links directly to stellar.expert so you can verify each one independently.</p></div><a href="https://stellar.expert/explorer/public" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="shrink-0 mkt-mono rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] px-3 py-1.5 text-caption text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:border-accent/30 hover:text-accent">stellar.expert ↗</a></div></div></div>"`;

exports[`English copy of the stats, registry, playground and content pages and the blog index registry renders the recorded markup 1`] = `"<section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20 lg:px-8 lg:py-24"><div class="max-w-2xl"><span class="mkt-eyebrow inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-fg-muted"><span class="h-px w-5 bg-line-strong"></span>Registry</span><h1 class="mkt-display mt-4 text-4xl font-bold text-white sm:text-5xl">What LumenWipe treats as an exchange.</h1><p class="mt-5 text-body leading-relaxed text-white/70">A close into an exchange needs the memo type that exchange enforces, and most exchanges need the balance passed on through the shared relay account. This page lists the exchanges the app recognizes, the rule it applies to each, and which DeFi protocols it can exit today, each with the date it was last checked.</p><p class="mt-4 text-body leading-relaxed text-white/70">The addresses below are the ones the app recognizes, not addresses to send to. Always take your deposit address and memo from your exchange.</p></div><div class="mt-12 space-y-14"><div><h2 class="mkt-display text-2xl font-bold text-white">Exchanges and memo rules</h2><div class="mt-3 space-y-2"><p aria-live="polite" class="text-sm text-fg-muted">Reading the API&#x27;s copy. Shown meanwhile: the copy shipped with this site.</p><p class="mkt-mono text-caption text-fg-subtle">Last checked <time dateTime="2026-11-17">2026-11-17</time> · relied on until<!-- --> <time dateTime="2027-02-15">2027-02-15</time></p><div aria-live="polite"></div><p class="max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">The API&#x27;s copy is not signed, so it can only make a rule stricter. It can add an exchange, but a close passes through the relay account only for an exchange listed in the copy shipped with this site.</p></div><ul class="mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><li class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] p-4"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Coinbase<!-- --> <span class="font