xt-sm"><caption class="sr-only">DeFi protocols and whether the app can exit them</caption><thead><tr class="border-b border-white/10 text-fg-muted"><th scope="col" class="p-3 font-medium">Protocol</th><th scope="col" class="p-3 font-medium">Exit status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-t border-white/[0.06]"><th scope="row" class="p-3 font-semibold text-white">Blend</th><td class="p-3 text-white/75">Live</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-white/[0.06]"><th scope="row" class="p-3 font-semibold text-white">Soroswap</th><td class="p-3 text-white/75">Live</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-white/[0.06]"><th scope="row" class="p-3 font-semibold text-white">Aquarius</th><td class="p-3 text-white/75">Live</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-white/[0.06]"><th scope="row" class="p-3 font-semibold text-white">Phoenix</th><td class="p-3 text-white/75">Live</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-white/[0.06]"><th scope="row" class="p-3 font-semibold text-white">FxDAO</th><td class="p-3 text-white/75">Testnet only</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section>"`;

exports[`English copy of the stats, registry, playground and content pages and the blog index playground renders the recorded markup 1`] = `"<section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl px-4 pb-24 pt-24 text-center sm:px-6"><p class="mkt-eyebrow mb-3 text-fg-muted">Testnet playground</p><h1 class="mkt-display text-4xl text-white sm:text-5xl">Try the exact same close, risk-free</h1><p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-white/70">The playground runs on the LumenWipe API and walks the identical close flow as the app - trustlines, offers, data entries, signers, the merge - against a disposable testnet account we hand you. No wallet, no real funds, nothing to lose.</p><a href="https://playground.lumenwipe.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-control font-semibold transition-colors duration-fast ease-standard disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40 bg-accent text-accent-fg not-disabled:hover:bg-accent/90 not-disabled:active:bg-accent/80 min-h-12 px-5 text-sm group mt-8">Open the playground<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><div class="mt-6"><a class="inline-block text-sm text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline" href="/testnet">Or close your own testnet account →</a></div></section>"`;

exports[`English copy of the stats, registry, playground and content pages and the blog index content renders the recorded markup 1`] = `"<div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 py-14 lg:px-8 lg:py-20"><div class="mb-14"><span class="mkt-eyebrow inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-fg-muted"><span class="h-px w-6 bg-line-strong"></span>Content</span><h1 class="mkt-display mt-4 mb-3 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">Videos &amp; articles</h1><p class="max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-white/70">Walkthroughs, deep dives, and guides on closing Stellar accounts and recovering locked reserves.</p></div><section class="mb-16"><h2 class="mkt-display mb-6 text-xl font-bold text-white">Videos</h2><div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><div class="mkt-card flex flex-col overflow-hidden"><div class="relative aspect-video w-full overflow-hidden bg-surface-sunken"><button type="button" aria-label="Play video: What is LumenWipe?" class="group absolute inset-0 h-full w-full focus-visible:-outline-offset-2"><img src="/video-posters/vD3xhPpqah8.webp" alt="" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"/><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center"><span class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-canvas/85 text-fg ring-1 ring-line-strong transition-colors group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-accent-fg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play ml-0.5 h-6 w-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z"></path></svg></span></span></button></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-2 p-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="mkt-mono rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] px-2 py-0.5 text-caption uppercase tracking-wider text-fg-subtle">EN</span><span class="mkt-mono inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-caption text-fg-subtle"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play h-2.5 w-2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z"></path></svg>3 min</span></div><h3 class="mkt-display text-body font-semibold leading-snug text-white">What is LumenWipe?</h3><p class="text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">A 3-minute overview of what LumenWipe does, why Stellar reserves get locked, and how the non-custodial close flow works.</p></div></div><div class="mkt-card flex flex-col overflow-hidden"><div class="relative aspect-video w-full overflow-hidden bg-surface-sunken"><button type="button" aria-label="Play video: Full walkthrough: testnet, playground &amp; mainnet" class="group absolute inset-0 h-full w-full focus-visible:-outline-offset-2"><img src="/video-posters/nVS2zI9mRzw.webp" alt="" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"/><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center"><span class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-canvas/85 text-fg ring-1 ring-line-strong transition-colors group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-accent-fg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play ml-0.5 h-6 w-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z"></path></svg></span></span></button></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-2 p-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="mkt-mono rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] px-2 py-0.5 text-caption uppercase tracking-wider text-fg-subtle">EN</span><span class="mkt-mono inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-caption text-fg-subtle"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play h-2.5 w-2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z"></path></svg>11 min</span></div><h3 class="mkt-display text-body font-semibold leading-snug text-white">Full walkthrough: testnet, playground &amp; mainnet</h3><p class="text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">An 11-minute demo covering the full close flow - from testnet dry run to a live mainnet account close.</p></div></div><div class="mkt-card flex flex-col overflow-hidden"><div class="relative aspect-video w-full overflow-hidden bg-surface-sunken"><button type="button" aria-label="Play video: Demo completo: testnet, playground y mainnet" class="group absolute inset-0 h-full w-full focus-visible:-outline-offset-2"><img src="/video-posters/eRkcNd9996c.webp" alt="" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"/><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center"><span class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-canvas/85 text-fg ring-1 ring-line-strong transition-colors group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-accent-fg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play ml-0.5 h-6 w-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z"></path></svg></span></span></button></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-2 p-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="mkt-mono rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] px-2 py-0.5 text-caption uppercase tracking-wider text-fg-subtle">ES</span><span class="mkt-mono inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-caption text-fg-subtle"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play h-2.5 w-2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z"></path></svg>14 min</span></div><h3 class="mkt-display text-body font-semibold leading-snug text-white">Demo completo: testnet, playground y mainnet</h3><p class="text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Demo de 14 minutos que cubre el flujo completo: testnet, playground y cierre real en mainnet.</p></div></div></div></section><div class="mb-14 border-t border-white/[0.07]"></div><section><h2 class="mkt-display mb-6 text-xl font-bold text-white">From the blog</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-2"><a class="group flex flex-col mkt-panel rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-accent/40 transition-colors duration-200" href="/blog/cant-merge-a-stellar-account-because-of-extra-signers"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-badge border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium border-success/30 bg-success/10 text-success">Guides</span></div><h2 class="mkt-display text-lg font-bold text-white leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200">Can&#x27;t Merge a Stellar Account With Extra Signers? Check the Thresholds</h2><p class="text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed mb-4 flex-1 line-clamp-3">Extra signers do not stop a Stellar account merge. What they can change is who has to sign it: how weights and thresholds work, what a failed merge&#x27;s result code tells you, and what a multisig close needs from you.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mkt-mono text-caption text-fg-subtle mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-white/8"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v3"></path><path d="M16 2v3"></path><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 9h18"></path></svg><time dateTime="2026-11-15">November 15, 2026</time></span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>7 min read</span></div></a><a class="group flex flex-col mkt-panel rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-accent/40 transition-colors duration-200" href="/blog/how-do-i-cancel-open-offers-on-stellar"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-badge border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium border-success/30 bg-success/10 text-success">Guides</span></div><h2 class="mkt-display text-lg font-bold text-white leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200">How Do I Cancel Open Offers on Stellar Before Closing My Account?</h2><p class="text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed mb-4 flex-1 line-clamp-3">What an open offer on the Stellar DEX is, how it holds a subentry and part of your balance, why it stops an account merge, and how cancelling it works.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mkt-mono text-caption text-fg-subtle mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-white/8"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v3"></path><path d="M16 2v3"></path><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 9h18"></path></svg><time dateTime="2026-11-15">November 15, 2026</time></span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>5 min read</span></div></a><a class="group flex flex-col mkt-panel rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-accent/40 transition-colors duration-200" href="/blog/how-do-i-remove-a-trustline-on-stellar"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-badge border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium border-success/30 bg-success/10 text-success">Guides</span></div><h2 class="mkt-display text-lg font-bold text-white leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200">How Do I Remove a Trustline on Stellar?</h2><p class="text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed mb-4 flex-1 line-clamp-3">Why every trustline has to go before a Stellar account can be merged, why a trustline only comes off at a zero balance, and what to do with the balance it still holds.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mkt-mono text-caption text-fg-subtle mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-white/8"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v3"></path><path d="M16 2v3"></path><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 9h18"></path></svg><time dateTime="2026-11-15">November 15, 2026</time></span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>6 min read</span></div></a><a class="group flex flex-col mkt-panel rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-accent/40 transition-colors duration-200" href="/blog/what-are-stellar-data-entries"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-badge border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium border-success/30 bg-success/10 text-success">Guides</span></div><h2 class="mkt-display text-lg font-bold text-white leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200">What Are Stellar Data Entries and How Do I Remove Them?</h2><p class="text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed mb-4 flex-1 line-clamp-3">What a Stellar data entry is, who creates them, why each one locks a reserve and stops an account merge, and how deleting one works.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mkt-mono text-caption text-fg-subtle mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-white/8"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v3"></path><path d="M16 2v3"></path><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 9h18"></path></svg><time dateTime="2026-11-15">November 15, 2026</time></span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>4 min read</span></div></a><a class="group flex flex-col mkt-panel rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-accent/40 transition-colors duration-200" href="/blog/why-cant-i-merge-my-stellar-account-claimable-balances"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-badge border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium border-success/30 bg-success/10 text-success">Guides</span></div><h2 class="mkt-display text-lg font-bold text-white leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200">Why Can&#x27;t I Merge My Stellar Account? Claimable Balances Explained</h2><p class="text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed mb-4 flex-1 line-clamp-3">What a claimable balance is, when one stops a Stellar account merge and when it does not, and what you can do with each balance before you close the account.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mkt-mono text-caption text-fg-subtle mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-white/8"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v3"></path><path d="M16 2v3"></path><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 9h18"></path></svg><time dateTime="2026-11-15">November 15, 2026</time></span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>5 min read</span></div></a><a class="group flex flex-col mkt-panel rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-accent/40 transition-colors duration-200" href="/blog/phase-2-launch"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-badge border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium border-warning/30 bg-warning/20 text-warning">Updates</span></div><h2 class="mkt-display text-lg font-bold text-white leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200">DeFi Exits, Soroban Tokens, and Allowances</h2><p class="text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed mb-4 flex-1 line-clamp-3">New in LumenWipe: DeFi position detection, exits from Blend, Aquarius, and Soroswap, Soroban token conversion, an allowance inspector, and an adversarial test suite with a published threat model.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mkt-mono text-caption text-fg-subtle mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-white/8"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v3"></path><path d="M16 2v3"></path><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 9h18"></path></svg><time dateTime="2026-09-30">September 30, 2026</time></span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>7 min read</span></div></a><a class="group flex flex-col mkt-panel rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-accent/40 transition-colors duration-200" href="/blog/phase-1-launch"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-badge border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium border-warning/30 bg-warning/20 text-warning">Updates</span></div><h2 class="mkt-display text-lg font-bold text-white leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200">Claimable Balances, Multisig Accounts, and Keeping What You Choose to Keep</h2><p class="text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed mb-4 flex-1 line-clamp-3">New in LumenWipe: full claimable-balance handling, a third per-asset disposition that lets you transfer instead of forfeit, a hardened account-state read path, and multisig accounts closed end to end.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mkt-mono text-caption text-fg-subtle mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-white/8"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v3"></path><path d="M16 2v3"></path><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 9h18"></path></svg><time dateTime="2026-09-06">September 6, 2026</time></span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>4 min read</span></div></a><a class="group flex flex-col mkt-panel rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-accent/40 transition-colors duration-200" href="/blog/account-merge-on-stellar"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-badge border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium border-accent/30 bg-accent/10 text-accent">Technical</span></div><h2 class="mkt-display text-lg font-bold text-white leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200">Account Merge on Stellar: A Complete Technical Reference</h2><p class="text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed mb-4 flex-1 line-clamp-3">A technical reference for the AccountMerge operation on Stellar: prerequisites, reserve recovery math, XDR structure, result codes, and how automated wind-down tools handle the full flow.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mkt-mono text-caption text-fg-subtle mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-white/8"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v3"></path><path d="M16 2v3"></path><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 9h18"></path></svg><time dateTime="2026-06-02">June 2, 2026</time></span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>8 min read</span></div></a><a class="group flex flex-col mkt-panel rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-accent/40 transition-colors duration-200" href="/blog/phase-0-launch"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-badge border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium border-warning/30 bg-warning/20 text-warning">Updates</span></div><h2 class="mkt-display text-lg font-bold text-white leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200">Introducing LumenWipe: Close a Stellar Account Step by Step</h2><p class="text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed mb-4 flex-1 line-clamp-3">LumenWipe is live: a non-custodial, guided workflow to close Stellar accounts, recover locked XLM reserves, and remove trustlines and offers safely.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mkt-mono text-caption text-fg-subtle mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-white/8"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v3"></path><path d="M16 2v3"></path><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 9h18"></path></svg><time dateTime="2026-06-02">June 2, 2026</time></span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>3 min read</span></div></a></div></section><section aria-labelledby="content-status" class="mt-16"><h2 id="content-status" class="mkt-display mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-white">Article status</h2><p class="mb-6 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/70">What is published and what is planned next.</p><div class="mkt-panel overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl"><table class="w-full text-left text-sm"><caption class="sr-only">Published and planned articles</caption><thead><tr class="border-b border-white/10 mkt-mono text-caption uppercase tracking-wider text-fg-subtle"><th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Article</th><th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Status</th><th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Published</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-b border-white/[0.07] last:border-0"><th scope="row" class="px-4 py-3 font-normal tex