ned","url":"https:\\u002f\\u002fwww.lumenwipe.com\\u002fblog\\u002fwhy-cant-i-merge-my-stellar-account-claimable-balances","datePublished":"2026-11-15T00:00:00Z","dateModified":"2026-11-15T00:00:00Z"},{"@type":"BlogPosting","headline":"DeFi Exits, Soroban Tokens, and Allowances","url":"https:\\u002f\\u002fwww.lumenwipe.com\\u002fblog\\u002fphase-2-launch","datePublished":"2026-09-30T00:00:00Z","dateModified":"2026-11-15T00:00:00Z"},{"@type":"BlogPosting","headline":"Claimable Balances, Multisig Accounts, and Keeping What You Choose to Keep","url":"https:\\u002f\\u002fwww.lumenwipe.com\\u002fblog\\u002fphase-1-launch","datePublished":"2026-09-06T00:00:00Z","dateModified":"2026-11-15T00:00:00Z"},{"@type":"BlogPosting","headline":"Account Merge on Stellar: A Complete Technical Reference","url":"https:\\u002f\\u002fwww.lumenwipe.com\\u002fblog\\u002faccount-merge-on-stellar","datePublished":"2026-06-02T00:00:00Z","dateModified":"2026-11-17T00:00:00Z"},{"@type":"BlogPosting","headline":"Introducing LumenWipe: Close a Stellar Account Step by Step","url":"https:\\u002f\\u002fwww.lumenwipe.com\\u002fblog\\u002fphase-0-launch","datePublished":"2026-06-02T00:00:00Z","dateModified":"2026-11-15T00:00:00Z"}]},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https:\\u002f\\u002fwww.lumenwipe.com\\u002f"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Blog","item":"https:\\u002f\\u002fwww.lumenwipe.com\\u002fblog"}]}]}</script><div class="mb-12"><span class="mkt-eyebrow inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-fg-muted"><span class="h-px w-6 bg-line-strong"></span>Blog</span><h1 class="mkt-display text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mt-4 mb-3 tracking-tight">Field notes on closing Stellar accounts</h1><p class="text-white/85 text-base max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">Technical deep dives, project updates, and guides on Stellar account management, reserve recovery, and non-custodial tooling.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5"><a class="group flex flex-col mkt-panel rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-accent/40 transition-colors duration-200" href="/blog/cant-merge-a-stellar-account-because-of-extra-signers"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-badge border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium border-success/30 bg-success/10 text-success">Guides</span></div><h2 class="mkt-display text-lg font-bold text-white leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200">Can&#x27;t Merge a Stellar Account With Extra Signers? Check the Thresholds</h2><p class="text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed mb-4 flex-1 line-clamp-3">Extra signers do not stop a Stellar account merge. What they can change is who has to sign it: how weights and thresholds work, what a failed merge&#x27;s result code tells you, and what a multisig close needs from you.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mkt-mono text-caption text-fg-subtle mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-white/8"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v3"></path><path d="M16 2v3"></path><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 9h18"></path></svg><time dateTime="2026-11-15">November 15, 2026</time></span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>7 min read</span></div></a><a class="group flex flex-col mkt-panel rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-accent/40 transition-colors duration-200" href="/blog/how-do-i-cancel-open-offers-on-stellar"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-badge border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium border-success/30 bg-success/10 text-success">Guides</span></div><h2 class="mkt-display text-lg font-bold text-white leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200">How Do I Cancel Open Offers on Stellar Before Closing My Account?</h2><p class="text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed mb-4 flex-1 line-clamp-3">What an open offer on the Stellar DEX is, how it holds a subentry and part of your balance, why it stops an account merge, and how cancelling it works.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mkt-mono text-caption text-fg-subtle mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-white/8"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v3"></path><path d="M16 2v3"></path><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 9h18"></path></svg><time dateTime="2026-11-15">November 15, 2026</time></span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>5 min read</span></div></a><a class="group flex flex-col mkt-panel rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-accent/40 transition-colors duration-200" href="/blog/how-do-i-remove-a-trustline-on-stellar"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-badge border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium border-success/30 bg-success/10 text-success">Guides</span></div><h2 class="mkt-display text-lg font-bold text-white leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200">How Do I Remove a Trustline on Stellar?</h2><p class="text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed mb-4 flex-1 line-clamp-3">Why every trustline has to go before a Stellar account can be merged, why a trustline only comes off at a zero balance, and what to do with the balance it still holds.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mkt-mono text-caption text-fg-subtle mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-white/8"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v3"></path><path d="M16 2v3"></path><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 9h18"></path></svg><time dateTime="2026-11-15">November 15, 2026</time></span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>6 min read</span></div></a><a class="group flex flex-col mkt-panel rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-accent/40 transition-colors duration-200" href="/blog/what-are-stellar-data-entries"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-badge border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium border-success/30 bg-success/10 text-success">Guides</span></div><h2 class="mkt-display text-lg font-bold text-white leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200">What Are Stellar Data Entries and How Do I Remove Them?</h2><p class="text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed mb-4 flex-1 line-clamp-3">What a Stellar data entry is, who creates them, why each one locks a reserve and stops an account merge, and how deleting one works.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mkt-mono text-caption text-fg-subtle mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-white/8"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v3"></path><path d="M16 2v3"></path><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 9h18"></path></svg><time dateTime="2026-11-15">November 15, 2026</time></span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>4 min read</span></div></a><a class="group flex flex-col mkt-panel rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-accent/40 transition-colors duration-200" href="/blog/why-cant-i-merge-my-stellar-account-claimable-balances"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-badge border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium border-success/30 bg-success/10 text-success">Guides</span></div><h2 class="mkt-display text-lg font-bold text-white leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200">Why Can&#x27;t I Merge My Stellar Account? Claimable Balances Explained</h2><p class="text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed mb-4 flex-1 line-clamp-3">What a claimable balance is, when one stops a Stellar account merge and when it does not, and what you can do with each balance before you close the account.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mkt-mono text-caption text-fg-subtle mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-white/8"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v3"></path><path d="M16 2v3"></path><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 9h18"></path></svg><time dateTime="2026-11-15">November 15, 2026</time></span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>5 min read</span></div></a><a class="group flex flex-col mkt-panel rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-accent/40 transition-colors duration-200" href="/blog/phase-2-launch"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-badge border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium border-warning/30 bg-warning/20 text-warning">Updates</span></div><h2 class="mkt-display text-lg font-bold text-white leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200">DeFi Exits, Soroban Tokens, and Allowances</h2><p class="text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed mb-4 flex-1 line-clamp-3">New in LumenWipe: DeFi position detection, exits from Blend, Aquarius, and Soroswap, Soroban token conversion, an allowance inspector, and an adversarial test suite with a published threat model.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mkt-mono text-caption text-fg-subtle mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-white/8"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v3"></path><path d="M16 2v3"></path><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 9h18"></path></svg><time dateTime="2026-09-30">September 30, 2026</time></span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>7 min read</span></div></a><a class="group flex flex-col mkt-panel rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-accent/40 transition-colors duration-200" href="/blog/phase-1-launch"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-badge border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium border-warning/30 bg-warning/20 text-warning">Updates</span></div><h2 class="mkt-display text-lg font-bold text-white leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200">Claimable Balances, Multisig Accounts, and Keeping What You Choose to Keep</h2><p class="text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed mb-4 flex-1 line-clamp-3">New in LumenWipe: full claimable-balance handling, a third per-asset disposition that lets you transfer instead of forfeit, a hardened account-state read path, and multisig accounts closed end to end.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mkt-mono text-caption text-fg-subtle mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-white/8"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v3"></path><path d="M16 2v3"></path><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 9h18"></path></svg><time dateTime="2026-09-06">September 6, 2026</time></span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>4 min read</span></div></a><a class="group flex flex-col mkt-panel rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-accent/40 transition-colors duration-200" href="/blog/account-merge-on-stellar"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-badge border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium border-accent/30 bg-accent/10 text-accent">Technical</span></div><h2 class="mkt-display text-lg font-bold text-white leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200">Account Merge on Stellar: A Complete Technical Reference</h2><p class="text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed mb-4 flex-1 line-clamp-3">A technical reference for the AccountMerge operation on Stellar: prerequisites, reserve recovery math, XDR structure, result codes, and how automated wind-down tools handle the full flow.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mkt-mono text-caption text-fg-subtle mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-white/8"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v3"></path><path d="M16 2v3"></path><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 9h18"></path></svg><time dateTime="2026-06-02">June 2, 2026</time></span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>8 min read</span></div></a><a class="group flex flex-col mkt-panel rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-accent/40 transition-colors duration-200" href="/blog/phase-0-launch"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-badge border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium border-warning/30 bg-warning/20 text-warning">Updates</span></div><h2 class="mkt-display text-lg font-bold text-white leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200">Introducing LumenWipe: Close a Stellar Account Step by Step</h2><p class="text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed mb-4 flex-1 line-clamp-3">LumenWipe is live: a non-custodial, guided workflow to close Stellar accounts, recover locked XLM reserves, and remove trustlines and offers safely.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mkt-mono text-caption text-fg-subtle mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-white/8"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v3"></path><path d="M16 2v3"></path><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 9h18"></path></svg><time dateTime="2026-06-02">June 2, 2026</time></span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>3 min read</span></div></a></div></div>"`;

